<title>FRANCE: DASA bids for Siemens unit.</title>
<headline>DASA bids for Siemens unit.</headline>
<dateline>LE BOURGET, France 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz Aerospace AG has officially submitted a bid for the defence electronics division of Siemens AG, DASA chief executive Manfred Bischoff said on Sunday in a statement issued at the Paris airshow.</p>
<p>Bischoff gave no details about the amount DASA had bid or what form the offer took. Siemens has been trying to sell the unit since early this year.</p>
</text>
